{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch roof leaks, dump water, and survive the flood in this first-person score attack survival game. Master Arcade or Defend the House with run-changing wizard boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/f7aeee4ab3bf8fed79f92f87ad2cb09d.avif?t=1774588207\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Arcade mode drops you into the garage for a pure score chase. Leaks escalate the longer you survive, and every clean catch beats letting water hit the floor. Dump into the drain to stay alive, stack trick-shot multipliers, and push your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/df6ce127aa3eacfd7f75c744eb86c40f.avif?t=1774588207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras_big/df6ce127aa3eacfd7f75c744eb86c40f.avif?t=1774588207 width=800 height=448 /></span><br><br>Defend the House turns it into a four room run. Start in the bedroom, then push through the bathroom, kitchen and living room in order. Each room has a fixed leak quota. Survive long enough for that many leaks to fully finish instead of racing the drain. When the quota is met the door unlocks and you move to the next room.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/56dd70b77ac2a5c62e3e150a060f49b1.avif?t=1774588207\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br>Floor water carries across the whole run. When you step into a new room the current floor water is cut in half since the same water is now spread over more of the house, but it never fully resets. If the water line reaches your head height in any room the run is over.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/c4da0a7aeec27c77ac826d13a5208ca6.avif?t=1774588207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras_big/c4da0a7aeec27c77ac826d13a5208ca6.avif?t=1774588207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br>Between key levels you visit the wizard shopkeeper. Pick one boon from a small set of random options. Slow down leak spawns, reduce how many leaks can be active, move faster, throw farther or bring a safety tool that cuts the water bar or saves you once from a drowning spike. Boons last for that run and follow you between rooms. New runs start clean.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/6403be9c2c4235c01f39950f70ed72a6.avif?t=1774588207\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want a softer version you can flip on Chill Vibes. Floor water caps at a safer level and slowly drains back down so you can practice routes, containers and throws without losing the whole run as quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two main ways to play: garage Arcade score chase and four room Defend the House run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple first person controls for grabbing, carrying and throwing containers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between level wizard shop with run based boons that change how leaks, movement and scoring behave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings including a relaxed Chill option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and leaderboards for both Arcade and Defend runs</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Catch a Drop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/e08719eaf14eeeada0245e3e0671ea187ea3b090.jpg"},{"name":"Drain Some Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/4e92cd29c209667d34df39903d603943dcb7f7eb.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/abcf1f4d04a689bb6c6ec4293634d5b2fe60300a.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/e761eee0900df06ed751b38d65e3723df2b0ada9.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Level 10 on Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/fa86d311bb0ee7e5c5a7382b6df43e52fc90e512.jpg"},{"name":"Choose a Boon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/f4a73bc6a3bb891cc77b532f5dbcc95c90858de8.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Level 10 on Normal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/fa86d311bb0ee7e5c5a7382b6df43e52fc90e512.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Level 10 on Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835950/fa86d311bb0ee7e5c5a7382b6df43e52fc90e512.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835950?t=1774588207","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835950?t=1774588207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/a9eeb121d2fe362da513c6b9a39555ca7c074c74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774588207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/a9eeb121d2fe362da513c6b9a39555ca7c074c74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774588207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch roof leaks, dump water, and survive the flood in this first-person score attack survival game. Master Arcade or Defend the House with run-changing wizard boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/f7aeee4ab3bf8fed79f92f87ad2cb09d.avif?t=1774588207\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Arcade mode drops you into the garage for a pure score chase. Leaks escalate the longer you survive, and every clean catch beats letting water hit the floor. Dump into the drain to stay alive, stack trick-shot multipliers, and push your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/df6ce127aa3eacfd7f75c744eb86c40f.avif?t=1774588207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras_big/df6ce127aa3eacfd7f75c744eb86c40f.avif?t=1774588207 width=800 height=448 /></span><br><br>Defend the House turns it into a four room run. Start in the bedroom, then push through the bathroom, kitchen and living room in order. Each room has a fixed leak quota. Survive long enough for that many leaks to fully finish instead of racing the drain. When the quota is met the door unlocks and you move to the next room.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/56dd70b77ac2a5c62e3e150a060f49b1.avif?t=1774588207\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br>Floor water carries across the whole run. When you step into a new room the current floor water is cut in half since the same water is now spread over more of the house, but it never fully resets. If the water line reaches your head height in any room the run is over.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/c4da0a7aeec27c77ac826d13a5208ca6.avif?t=1774588207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras_big/c4da0a7aeec27c77ac826d13a5208ca6.avif?t=1774588207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br>Between key levels you visit the wizard shopkeeper. Pick one boon from a small set of random options. Slow down leak spawns, reduce how many leaks can be active, move faster, throw farther or bring a safety tool that cuts the water bar or saves you once from a drowning spike. Boons last for that run and follow you between rooms. New runs start clean.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/6403be9c2c4235c01f39950f70ed72a6.avif?t=1774588207\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want a softer version you can flip on Chill Vibes. Floor water caps at a safer level and slowly drains back down so you can practice routes, containers and throws without losing the whole run as quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two main ways to play: garage Arcade score chase and four room Defend the House run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple first person controls for grabbing, carrying and throwing containers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between level wizard shop with run based boons that change how leaks, movement and scoring behave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings including a relaxed Chill option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and leaderboards for both Arcade and Defend runs</p></li></ul>","deve